{
  "alias": "pulsar",
  "description": "pulsar, run by make conformance. Test credentials only, published deliberately; see SECURITY.md.",
  "server": {
    "discoveryUrl": "https://pulsar:9443/.well-known/openid-configuration"
  },
  "client": {
    "client_id": "conformance-client",
    "client_secret": "conformance-client-secret"
  },
  "browser": [
    {
      "comment": "The authorization each module starts with: the login page and the consent page when pulsar shows them, then the suite's callback page.",
      "match": "https://pulsar:9443/authorize*",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task": "Login",
          "optional": true,
          "match": "https://pulsar:9443/login*",
          "commands": [
            ["text", "name", "username", "conformance"],
            ["text", "name", "password", "conformance-password"],
            ["click", "xpath", "//button[@type='submit']"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "task": "Consent",
          "optional": true,
          "match": "https://pulsar:9443/authorize*",
          "commands": [
            ["click", "xpath", "//button[normalize-space()='Allow']"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "task": "Verify Complete",
          "match": "https://localhost.emobix.co.uk:8443/test/a/pulsar/callback*",
          "commands": [["wait", "id", "submission_complete", 10]]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "A logout that returns to the Client: pulsar asks the End-User to confirm, and then redirects to the registered post_logout_redirect_uri. The confirm step is optional, so that a module whose logout redirects at once still runs.",
      "match": "https://pulsar:9443/logout*",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task": "Confirm logout",
          "optional": true,
          "match": "https://pulsar:9443/logout*",
          "commands": [
            ["click", "xpath", "//button[normalize-space()='Sign out']"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "task": "Verify Complete",
          "match": "https://localhost.emobix.co.uk:8443/test/a/pulsar/post_logout_redirect*",
          "commands": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "override": {
    "oidcc-rp-initiated-logout-bad-post-logout-redirect-uri": {
      "browser": [
        {
          "comment": "The same authorization as every module's.",
          "match": "https://pulsar:9443/authorize*",
          "tasks": [
            {
              "task": "Login",
              "optional": true,
              "match": "https://pulsar:9443/login*",
              "commands": [
                ["text", "name", "username", "conformance"],
                ["text", "name", "password", "conformance-password"],
                ["click", "xpath", "//button[@type='submit']"]
              ]
            },
            {
              "task": "Consent",
              "optional": true,
              "match": "https://pulsar:9443/authorize*",
              "commands": [
                ["click", "xpath", "//button[normalize-space()='Allow']"]
              ]
            },
            {
              "task": "Verify Complete",
              "match": "https://localhost.emobix.co.uk:8443/test/a/pulsar/callback*",
              "commands": [["wait", "id", "submission_complete", 10]]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "An unregistered post_logout_redirect_uri: pulsar asks the End-User to confirm, naming the Client its hint identifies, and will not redirect (RP-Initiated Logout 1.0 §3, REQ-LOGOUT-9); the confirmation page fills the module's placeholder.",
          "match": "https://pulsar:9443/logout*",
          "tasks": [
            {
              "task": "Expect the confirmation page",
              "match": "https://pulsar:9443/logout*",
              "commands": [
                [
                  "wait",
                  "xpath",
                  "//*",
                  10,
                  "asks to sign you out",
                  "update-image-placeholder"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
